  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Staff Selection Commission, SSC</a> </span>has released the <strong>PE &amp; MT Admit Card</strong>&nbsp;for the <strong data-start=\"240\" data-end=\"278\">Delhi Police Constable (Executive)</strong> posts after evaluating candidates’ <strong data-start=\"314\" data-end=\"348\">performance in the examination</strong>. This recruitment was conducted for <strong data-start=\"385\" data-end=\"400\">7,201 posts</strong>. Applications for the <strong data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"482\">SSC Delhi Police Constable (Executive) Recruitment 2025</strong> were accepted from <strong data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"542\">22 September 2025 to 31 October 2025</strong>. The <strong>PE &amp; MT</strong> will be held from <strong data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"617\">19 August 2026 to 01 September 2026</strong>. Candidates who appeared for this examination can download their SSC Delhi Police Constable Executive <strong>PE &amp; MT Admit Card 2026</strong> which has given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Staff Selection Commission (SSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">SSC Delhi Police Constable Executive PE &amp; MT Admit Card 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>22 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>31 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>31 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Online Correction Date : <strong>Notify Later</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date : <strong>18 December 2025 to 06 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Self Slot Selection :<strong> 05 – 30 December 2025&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card : <strong>15</strong> <strong>December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key : <strong>13</strong> <strong>January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Result : <strong>19 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Final Answer Key : <strong>07 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Marks : <strong>07 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">PE &amp; MT Date : <strong>19 August to 01 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li>New PE &amp; MT Test Date :&nbsp;<strong>19 August To 10 September 2026</strong></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">PE &amp; MT Admit Card : <strong>08 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC :<strong> Rs. 100/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST :<strong> 0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Category Female :<strong> 0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SSC Delhi Police Constable Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 July 2025</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>25 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per SSC Delhi Police Constable Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #0000ff; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SSC Delhi Police Constable 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 7201</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 49.4315%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.5571%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Category&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.0113%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 49.4315%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Constable Executive</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.5571%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.0113%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">3174</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.5571%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.0113%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">756</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.5571%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">OBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.0113%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">1608</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.5571%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.0113%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">1386</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.5571%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.0113%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">641</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>SSC Delhi Police Constable Recruitment 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed their Class 10+2 (Intermediate) Examination from any Recognized Board in India with Valid (LMV) Driving License (for Male) will be eligible for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>SSC Delhi Police Constable Recruitment 2025 : Physical Measurement Test</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Measurement</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Male</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Female</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Height</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">UR, OBC, EWS, SC : <strong>170 cms </strong>ST : <strong>165 cms</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">UR, OBC, EWS, SC : <strong>81-85 cms </strong>ST : <strong>76-80 cms</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Chest</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">UR, OBC, EWS, SC : <strong>157 cms </strong>ST : <strong>155 cms</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">NA</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Delhi Police Constable Recruitment 2025 : PET Eligibility (Male)</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Race 1600 M</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Long Jump</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>High Jump</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Up to 30 Years</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">06 Minutes</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">14 Feet</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">3.9 Feet</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">30-40 Years</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">07 Minutes</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">13 Feet</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">3.6 Feet</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Above 40 Years</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">08 Minutes</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">12 Feet</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">3.3 Feet</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Delhi Police Constable Recruitment 2025 : PET Eligibility (Female)</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Race 1600 M</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Long Jump</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>High Jump</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Up to 30 Years</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">08 Minutes</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">10 Feet</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">03 Feet</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">30-40 Years</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">09 Minutes</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">09 Feet</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">2.9 Feet</span><